From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhenyao Mo <zmo@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 17:40:56 -0700
Subject: GPU: Lose context on 3D texture depth increase for Qualcomm

Lose the GL context when glTexImage3D is called on a mutable TEXTURE_3D
texture with an increased depth to work around a Qualcomm driver bug.

Bug: 530045332
Change-Id: I4673557a7e17cca7d2165dbb138bc89a6658e176
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8273535
Commit-Queue: Zhenyao Mo <zmo@chromium.org>
Auto-Submit: Zhenyao Mo <zmo@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Kenneth Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1684344}

Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y):
- gpu_driver_bug_list.json: the branch already carries later workaround
  entries (ids 491/492/493 via merges), so the new id 489 entry is appended
  at the end of the list instead of after id 488. No other changes.

